# Local map preview build (about 1.4 GB); never committed.
/..AI-Journal-map-preview/

# Firebase ADMIN credentials are private keys. Never commit them, even
# to a private repository. Only the non-secret Android google-services.json
# may be deliberately committed after verifying its package/project IDs.
**/fcm-sender.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/firebase-private-key*.json
**/google-application-credentials.json
